Bundle-Name: Fennec OData Persistence API
Bundle-Description: Backend-agnostic query SPI (req §3.5): EntityQuery (OCL predicate IR + paging) executed by a QueryService per backend, with EntityRepository as the data-source abstraction layer (files, in-memory, JPA, ...)

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.condition;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.m2x.ocl.model;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.odata.query;version=project,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.persistence;version=latest
